		<description><![CDATA[Ike Rivers was a gentle giant and a truly beautiful soul.  He could speak truth from his heart to yours / mine and you&#039;d know it when you had the good fortune to encounter him.  Ike wore these big shoes and I remember wearing them once when he came to my home.  I learned so much about grounded presence walking in those shoes.  I am forever grateful to this understated being.  I learned much from watching the beautiful realm he created around him, Karen and Cheri.  A truly Renaissance soul, or as Shabda quoted at Ike&#039;s memorial service, &#039;He built worlds before breakfast.&#039;  Some of those worlds are alive in my heart even today.  Ya Hu!]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Ike Rivers was a gentle giant and a truly beautiful soul.  He could speak truth from his heart to yours / mine and you&#8217;d know it when you had the good fortune to encounter him.  Ike wore these big shoes and I remember wearing them once when he came to my home.  I learned so much about grounded presence walking in those shoes.  I am forever grateful to this understated being.  I learned much from watching the beautiful realm he created around him, Karen and Cheri.  A truly Renaissance soul, or as Shabda quoted at Ike&#8217;s memorial service, &#8216;He built worlds before breakfast.&#8217;  Some of those worlds are alive in my heart even today.  Ya Hu!</p>
